## Session notes

- Implemented Better Auth scaffolding (`lib/auth/config.ts`, `lib/auth/server.ts`, `app/api/auth/[...better-auth]/route.ts`) and product-only auth pages (`app/(auth)/sign-in/page.tsx`, `app/(auth)/sign-up/page.tsx`).
- Added proxy-based protection for the authenticated app surface in `proxy.ts` targeting `/(app)` routes.
- Created initial service layer under `lib/effect/` (runtime helper plus `youtube.service.ts`, `comment-analysis.service.ts`, `market.service.ts`, `user-data.service.ts`) using pure, typed functions as placeholders for future Effect integration.
- Built the authenticated app shell and feature pages: `app/(app)/layout.tsx`, `app/(app)/dashboard/page.tsx`, `app/(app)/comments/page.tsx`, `app/(app)/market/page.tsx`, all wired to the service layer with mocked data.
- Updated `app/page.tsx` to be a minimal product entry that routes users into auth rather than a marketing landing.
- Updated `package.json` dependencies to include `better-auth` and `effect` (Effect is not yet fully wired into the services).

