- `lib/auth/config.ts`: new file, lines 1–48 – Better Auth configuration with Google provider and YouTube-related scopes.
- `lib/auth/server.ts`: new file, lines 1–32 – Session helper adapting Better Auth session shape for server-side usage.
- `app/api/auth/[...better-auth]/route.ts`: new file, lines 1–39 – Thin adapter delegating GET/POST to Better Auth.
- `app/(auth)/sign-in/page.tsx`: new file, lines 1–40 – Simple sign-in screen with Google/YouTube CTA.
- `app/(auth)/sign-up/page.tsx`: new file, lines 1–32 – Simple sign-up screen mirroring sign-in behavior.
- `proxy.ts`: new file, lines 1–30 – Guards `/(app)` routes and redirects unauthenticated users to `/(auth)/sign-in`.
- `lib/effect/runtime.ts`: new file, lines 1–7 – Utility `runEffect` wrapper around synchronous/async functions (placeholder for future Effect usage).
- `lib/effect/youtube.service.ts`: new file, lines 1–94 – Types and mocked implementations for dashboard snapshot and video comments.
- `lib/effect/comment-analysis.service.ts`: new file, lines 1–48 – Comment clustering types and a basic mock `getCommentInsights`.
- `lib/effect/market.service.ts`: new file, lines 1–63 – Market overview types and a mock `getMarketOverview`.
- `lib/effect/user-data.service.ts`: new file, lines 1–35 – User profile and connected channel types with a mock `getUserProfile`.
- `app/(app)/layout.tsx`: new file, lines 1–35 – Creator workspace shell with sidebar navigation.
- `app/(app)/dashboard/page.tsx`: new file, lines 1–79 – Dashboard UI consuming `getDashboardSnapshot`.
- `app/(app)/comments/page.tsx`: new file, lines 1–67 – Comment intelligence UI consuming `getVideoComments` and `getCommentInsights`.
- `app/(app)/market/page.tsx`: new file, lines 1–67 – Market radar UI consuming `getMarketOverview`.
- `app/page.tsx`: updated file, lines 1–33 – Replaced starter content with minimal sign-in/sign-up entry.
- `package.json`: updated dependencies section to add `better-auth` and `effect`.
 - `env.ts`: new file, lines 1–22 – Central `@t3-oss/env-core` schema for server env vars (Better Auth Google credentials and `NODE_ENV`).
 - `lib/auth/config.ts`: updated to read Google OAuth client id/secret from the typed `env` object instead of `process.env`.

